msgstr ""
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Language: zh_Hans\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=1; plural=0;\n"

msgid "Tunnel Watchdog"
msgstr "隧道看守"

msgid "Probes whether the tunnel actually carries traffic, and captures a forensic snapshot at the moment it stops. The probe is a random-label DNS query through the tunnel: a cached answer cannot satisfy it, so a reply proves the whole path worked."
msgstr "探测隧道是否真的在过流量，并在它停止的那一刻抓取现场快照。探针是一条经隧道发出的随机标签 DNS 查询：缓存无法应答它，所以只要有回应就证明整条链路是通的。"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Runs as a procd service, restarted automatically if it dies."
msgstr "以 procd 服务运行，异常退出会自动拉起。"

msgid "Check interval (s)"
msgstr "检查间隔（秒）"

msgid "Failures before an incident"
msgstr "判定为事故所需的连续失败次数"

msgid "Consecutive failed probes required before a snapshot is taken. Two at fifteen seconds means a fault has to persist for half a minute, which keeps a single dropped query out of the record."
msgstr "抓快照前需要连续失败几次。间隔 15 秒时取 2 次，意味着故障须持续半分钟，可以把偶发的单次丢包挡在记录之外。"

msgid "Re-snapshot interval (s)"
msgstr "持续故障时的重复抓取间隔（秒）"

msgid "While still down, take another snapshot this often."
msgstr "故障尚未恢复时，每隔这么久再抓一次。"

msgid "Incident log size cap (bytes)"
msgstr "事故日志大小上限（字节）"

msgid "The verbose log lives in /tmp, which is RAM. It rotates once above this size."
msgstr "详细日志在 /tmp，也就是内存里。超过这个大小就轮转一次。"

msgid "Probe domain"
msgstr "探测域名"

msgid "Must be a domain that is routed through the tunnel, i.e. one in gfw_list.conf. A domestic domain would resolve fine during a total outage and the probe would never fire."
msgstr "必须是走隧道的域名，即在 gfw_list.conf 里的。用国内域名的话，即使隧道完全中断它也能正常解析，探针永远不会触发。"

msgid "Domestic ICMP target"
msgstr "国内 ICMP 目标"

msgid "Pinged unproxied. Together with the overseas target this is what separates a broken uplink from a broken international route. Avoid 114.114.114.114: something on the path answers for it in 0 ms, so it measures nothing beyond the gateway."
msgstr "不走代理直接 ping。它和境外目标对照，才能区分「整条上行断了」和「只有国际出口断了」。不要用 114.114.114.114：路径上有设备替它 0 毫秒应答，测不到网关以外的任何东西。"

msgid "Overseas ICMP target"
msgstr "境外 ICMP 目标"

msgid "Pinged unproxied. Loss here with a clean domestic target puts the fault on the international egress, which nothing on this router can fix."
msgstr "不走代理直接 ping。国内目标干净而这里丢包，说明故障在国际出口上——那是路由器这边修不了的。"

msgid "Running"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "Enabled but not running"
msgstr "已启用但未在运行"

msgid "Stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

msgid "incident(s) in the last 7 days"
msgstr "次事故（近 7 天）"

msgid "recorded in total"
msgstr "条记录（累计）"

msgid "No incident has been recorded yet."
msgstr "尚未记录到任何事故。"

msgid "Capturing, about 40 seconds..."
msgstr "抓取中，约需 40 秒……"

msgid "Pinging three targets ten times each and sampling the WAN counters. Please wait."
msgstr "正在对三个目标各 ping 十次，并采样 WAN 计数器，请稍候。"

msgid "No output."
msgstr "无输出。"

msgid "Capture a snapshot now"
msgstr "立即抓取快照"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Service"
msgstr "服务"

msgid "Record"
msgstr "记录"

msgid "Recent events"
msgstr "最近事件"

msgid "Kept on flash at /etc/ssrp-watch.history and preserved across sysupgrade, so it outlives the reboot that so often follows an outage. The verbose snapshots live in /tmp/ssrp-incident.log and do not."
msgstr "保存在 flash 上的 /etc/ssrp-watch.history，并在 sysupgrade 时保留——事故之后往往紧跟一次重启，它要能活过去。详细快照在 /tmp/ssrp-incident.log，重启即失。"

msgid "Self-test"
msgstr "自检"

msgid "Takes the same snapshot an incident would, without touching the incident log or the state file. Safe to run while the daemon is live."
msgstr "抓取与事故时完全相同的快照，但不会写入事故日志或状态文件。守护进程运行期间也可以安全执行。"

msgid "Clear the record"
msgstr "清空记录"

msgid "Empties both the record on flash and the verbose snapshots. Restarting the tunnel logs an outage like any other, so a run of maintenance leaves entries worth discarding."
msgstr "同时清空 flash 上的记录与详细快照。重启隧道和真实断线一样会被记为一次中断，所以一轮维护之后往往会留下一批没有保留价值的条目。"

msgid "Discard every recorded event? The record on flash is erased and cannot be recovered."
msgstr "确定丢弃全部已记录事件？flash 上的记录将被清空且无法恢复。"

msgid "Clearing..."
msgstr "正在清空……"

msgid "Could not clear the record. Check that /etc/ssrp-watch.history is writable."
msgstr "清空失败。请检查 /etc/ssrp-watch.history 是否可写。"

msgid "The request timed out. The record may or may not have been cleared -- reload the page to see."
msgstr "请求超时。记录可能已清空也可能未清空——重新加载页面即可确认。"
